    skipped, and recursion never descends through symlinked directories.
    Any directory that should be visited but cannot be scanned fails the
    whole import with the path and reason.  Every confirmed subdirectory
    is opened through its pinned parent directory with
    ``O_DIRECTORY | O_NOFOLLOW`` and scanned through that descriptor, so
    a subdirectory replaced by a symbolic link at any moment before or
    during its scan fails the whole import instead of the link target
    being scanned.  The confirmed list lets the caller re-verify the
    directories once more after the candidate reads.
    """
